{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25994","headline":"感兴 · 鲍溶","name":"感兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽人无近迹，别易会则稀。\n黄鹤亦姓丁，寥寥何处飞？\n时见海上山，绕云心依依。\n谅无驭风术，中路愁虚归。\n童发慕道心，壮年堕尘机。\n白日不饶我，如今事皆非。\n羣羊化石尽，双凫与我违。\n□岳黄金富，轩辕晓霞衣。\n谁令日在眼，容色烟云微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}